<obfl xmlns="http://www.daisy.org/ns/2011/obfl" version="2011-1" xml:lang="en">
	<meta xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
		<dc:title>Volume keep with previous, start of block test</dc:title>
		<dc:description>Tests that keep-with-previous-sheets does not keep a block with the sheets before it.
		One short block is one sheet. A 4-sheet block with keep-with-previous-sheets="1" starts right after the target size of the
		first volume. Only the end of the block is kept with its previous sheet, so the volumes are 10 and 4 sheets,
		the same as without the keep-with-previous-sheets.</dc:description>
	</meta>
	<layout-master name="body" page-width="10" page-height="6" duplex="false">
		<default-template>
			<header/>
			<footer/>
		</default-template>
	</layout-master>
	<volume-template sheets-in-volume-max="10">
		<pre-content/>
		<post-content/>
	</volume-template>
	<sequence master="body">
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block keep-with-previous-sheets="1">⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
	</sequence>
</obfl>
